      "value": "UPDATE:\n\nhttps://youtube.com/shorts/C1OHyuBfYKA\n\nreproduction steps:\n\n- open vrchat.\n\n- while on the loading circle screen, press the home button (open the system dashboard thing) and leave it open.\n\n- when vrchat starts logging in, look down to see the Pico 4 Ultra controllers at their origins. these rendermodels are used for the controllers after closing the dashboard, until restarting the game.",
