  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "On base model Pico 4.\n\nThis has occurred twice in the past few sessions, but I'm not sure of the cause at the moment. I can only assume the game sometimes erroneously detects the system as an Ultra. (i see the log toggle will persist across sessions soon on non-pc, so if i remember when that goes live i will try to get the startup log)\n\nI'm also not 100% sure if it affects the positioning of the hand menus as well, but I it does seem to change the offset of the avatar hands; the high-poly avatar in the images usually fits my hands really well but is a bit off when this happens.",
